<p>Then those two tables get joined (in <code>joined_data</code> no less, points for unorinality?), so we know what certain teams achieved in a given month, how that compared to the national reference value, and a flag variable to help with the counting later on.</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb3" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode sql code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode sql"><span id="cb3-1">#| eval: <span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
