<p>Turning <code>joined_data</code> into <code>groups</code>, I then go over each team for each health board, and create a new group each time a data point lapses and a streak breaks while keeping the monthly ordering stable so we can accurately identify consistent patterns. It’s a little funny to read, but essentially what this code does is say “starting from 0, count how many zeros are in this team’s whole run”.</p>
